    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've heard all the \"it gets better\" stuff before. it really doesn't. i'm just so tired of fighting it every single day. sometimes i think i'd just be at peace if i could just stop existing. like, if i wasn't around, the weight would just be gone for everyone. i can't do this anymore. should i just end it?",
